」，表示帮某人做事。请求对方帮忙时可用「～を手伝ってくれませんか」。","pos":{"primary":"verb","classes":["verb"],"subtypes":[],"conjugation":"godan"},"transitivity":{"value":"transitive","scope":"lexeme"},"register":{"formality":"neutral","politeness":[],"usage":[]},"style":{"medium":"general","genres":[]},"lexical_review":{"schemaVersion":2,"status":"reviewed","confidence":"high","basis":["dictionary","context"],"note_zh":"「青木が手伝ってくれました」表示青木帮助说话人，手伝う的他动性不变；てくれる表示受益方向。","dictionary_sequences":[1328190],"identity":{"word":"手伝う","reading_hiragana":"てつだう","meaning":"帮忙"}}},"transitivity":{"value":"transitive","scope":"lexeme"},"register":{"formality":"neutral","politeness":[],"usage":[]},"style":{"medium":"general","genres":[]},"lexical_review":{"schemaVersion":2,"status":"reviewed","confidence":"high","basis":["dictionary","context"],"note_zh":"「青木が手伝ってくれました」表示青木帮助说话人，手伝う的他动性不变；てくれる表示受益方向。","dictionary_sequences":[1328190],"identity":{"word":"手伝う","reading_hiragana":"てつだう","meaning":"帮忙"}},"v4_enrichment":null,"jitendex_overlay":null,"vocab_audio_index":2241},{"source_index":1649,"source_label":"助かる","source_word":"助かる","split_part":1,"split_total":1,"label":"助かる","word":"助かる","reading_hiragana":"たすかる","meaning":"得到帮助、解决困难","meanings_zh":["得到帮助、解决困难"],"example_sentence_ja":"リーさんが場所を書いてくれたら、助かります。","example_sentence_zh":"如果李帮忙写下地点，那就帮大忙了。","example_sentences":[{"ja":"リーさんが場所を書いてくれたら、助かります。","zh":"如果李帮忙写下地点，那就帮大忙了。"}],"pos":{"primary":"verb","classes":["verb"],"subtypes":[],"conjugation":"godan"},"level":null,"textbook_uid":"cfv-684113cb979a5c5d","index":1649,"textbook_sources":[{"book_id":"KotobaFlow2","lesson_id":"lesson_10","lesson_title":"できる仕事を相談する","source_type":"lesson_vocab","source_kind":"curriculum_vocab"}],"curriculum_extension":{"id":"C28-V08","word":"助かる","reading":"たすかる","meaning_zh":"得到帮助、解决困难","role":"production","status":"recycle","examples":[{"id":"C28-V08-E01","ja":"リーさんが場所を書いてくれたら、助かります。","zh":"如果李帮忙写下地点，那就帮大忙了。"}],"notes_zh":"助かる是得到帮助、困难得到缓解；不是主动帮助别人的助ける。"},"learning_enrichment":{"t